  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that former US President Barack Obama has been involved with a documentary about Betty and Barney Hill, an American couple known for saying they were taken aboard a UFO, and that Obama visited the set of Disclosure Day, a film by the director Steven Spielberg. Michels tells it both as Obama thinking about producing the documentary and, another time, as Obama actually producing it. He sees it as a sign that Obama is quietly interested in the subject."
